---
---
<!-- ── WHY NOT THEM ── -->
<section class="why-not">
  <div class="why-not-inner">
    <div class="stag-o">Why Not the Other Guys?</div>
    <h2 class="sh-b" style="color:var(--cream);">We've worked alongside<br/>the big players. <em style="color:var(--flame);">Here's the truth.</em></h2>
    <p style="font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.75;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);max-width:620px;margin-bottom:0;font-weight:400;">After 75+ years of ownership experience deploying technology alongside — and cleaning up after — the biggest names in IT and telecom, we know exactly how they operate. You deserve to know too.</p>

    <div class="why-not-grid">
      <!-- THEM column -->
      <div>
        <div class="why-not-col-label them-label">The Big Guys</div>
        <div class="why-not-items">
          <div class="why-not-item them-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">📋</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">A ticket number, not a person</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">Open a ticket. Wait 24 hours. Get a response from someone who's never seen your setup. Escalate. Wait more. Meanwhile your business is down.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item them-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">👉</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">The vendor blame game</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">Your ISP blames your router. Your IT company blames your ISP. Your AV installer blames the network. Nobody owns the problem. You pay all of them anyway.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item them-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">📈</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">Hardware markup as a profit center</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">Your IT vendor quotes you a switch. Retail is $400. They charge $700. You'd never know — until you looked it up. Most don't look it up.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item them-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">📊</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">"Up to" speeds that are never that</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">That 500 Mbps plan your ISP sold you? It's "up to" 500. In practice, during business hours, under load? Run our quality test and see what you're actually getting.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item them-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">🔒</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">3-year contracts because they know you'll hate it</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">Long contracts aren't confidence — they're a hedge. If they were genuinely good, they wouldn't need to trap you to keep your business.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- US column -->
      <div>
        <div class="why-not-col-label us-label">HowdyNET</div>
        <div class="why-not-items">
          <div class="why-not-item us-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">📱</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">A real human. Our actual number.</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">(512) 200-4744. Call or text. Someone who already knows your setup answers — because we documented everything when we built it.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item us-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">🤠</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">One throat to choke. Ours.</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">We own your internet, your network, your cameras, your AV, and your IT. When something breaks, there's one call. Nobody to point at but us — and we're fine with that.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item us-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">🏷️</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">Hardware at our cost. Full stop.</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">We're authorized dealers. What we pay, you pay. No markup, no margin game, no mystery quote. We make money on the service — not on the gear.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item us-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">📡</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">We own the network. We guarantee the speed.</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">We're a licensed WISP. We don't resell someone else's internet and hope for the best. We engineer for quality — symmetric speeds, low latency, zero throttling.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-not-item us-item">
            <div class="why-not-icon">🤝</div>
            <div>
              <div class="why-not-item-title">Month-to-month. Earn it every month.</div>
              <div class="why-not-item-body">No multi-year trap. We stay because we're worth it, not because you're locked in. That's the kind of accountability we'd want if we were the client.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-not-cta">
      <div class="why-not-cta-text">S'pose it's time to put all your tech under one hat.</div>
      <div class="why-not-cta-sub">No pitch. No queue. Just a real conversation — and one hat big enough for all of it.</div>
      <a href="#contact" style="font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--flame);color:var(--white);padding:14px 32px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(232,106,26,0.3);transition:background 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='var(--light-o)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='var(--flame)'">Say Howdy →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
